comment.narrative:
Measured at the level of Principle Urban Center LGs: Percentage of LGs which have executed at least the minimum annual target levels of expenditures as compared to their annual investment plan.  
Restructuring changes: Reduction of annual and final targets to address some COVID-19 related negative impacts on LG's ability to execute public investments. Clarification of minimum threshold, triggering disbursement, as per FA. 
Annual target levels are: 
Y1: 10% of LGs. 
Y2:?40% of LGs have financially executed 25% of their annual investment plans (AIPs); 
Y3: 50% of LGs have financially executed 30% of their AIPs; 
Y4: 60% of LGs have financially executed 40% o their?AIPs; 
Y5: 70% of LGs have financially executed 50% of their?AIPs. 

Y6: no target 

Y7: 30% of LGs have financially executed 30% of their AIPs. For target 2025, Pending verification early 2025 with transmission of 2024 achievement reports of LGs and reports on the SITEX financial implementation reports on the status of PAI im

